%% DPPL: interaksi teknis berdasarkan skenario SKPL
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor WorkshopOwner as Workshop Owner
    participant UI as Browser UI
    participant Service as WorkshopService
    participant Records as WorkshopRepository
    participant Dep as AccessPolicy
    WorkshopOwner->>UI: Select a workshop, branch, and employee
    UI->>Service: Submit employee and branch access management request
    Service->>Records: Check owner scope and branch assignment
    Records-->>Service: Return current records and validation result
    Service->>Service: Validate kepemilikan bengkel dan role staf
    alt Valid
        Service->>Dep: requireWorkshopScope(owner, workshop)
        Dep-->>Service: Result
        Service->>Records: Save branch-specific employee access
        Records-->>Service: Confirm the saved or calculated result
        Service-->>UI: Display updated employee permissions
        UI-->>WorkshopOwner: Display the result and next step
    else Request needs correction or review
        Service-->>UI: Reject access outside owned branches
        UI-->>WorkshopOwner: Display the reason and required action
    end
